A production ready framework for a multi-agent trading application using
  pydantic-ai. The aim of the application is to help a professional trader to select the
  financial instrument that offers possible opportunities based on market data. The trader
  will maintain a list of favourite trading instruments and the application will review that
  list and provide suggestion of the best instruments to trade. The application then analyses
  the instruments selected from the suggestions and conducts everal analyses using
  fundamentals relevant for that instrument, news and sentiment analysis as well as technical
  analysis. The application then determines the best possible entry, stop loss and profit
  takers based on market data and the preconfigured minimum risk to reward ratio. The
  application then conducts a risks analysis using all the provided data before creating a
  summary of the proposed trades. Tha applicatio makes use of existing MCP services such as that from
  alpha vantage for news and tecnical analysis